+| reference claims `op a b = op b a` from associativity alone; Lean adds the instance | REFERENCE_NEEDS_ASSUMPTION (reference false) | `Bool`, `op a b := a`, `a = true`, `b = false` |
+| reference over ℤ; Lean adds `0 ≤ a` | LEAN_WEAKER_BY_ASSUMPTION | `a = −1` |
+| Lean drops injectivity | LEAN_CLAIM_FALSE | `Bool`, constant function |
+| added antisymmetry | LEAN_WEAKER_BY_ASSUMPTION | `Bool`, the total relation |
